<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Safety Tips Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
  p, li { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_1.jpg" alt="Pedestrian crossing image" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Safety Tips</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">for Drivers, Pedestrians and Bus Transportation</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Contact Us</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">The contents of this pamphlet were written by</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 5px;"><span data-field="department_name">{{ department_name }}</span> Please direct questions or concerns to Director of Environmental Health and Safety <span data-field="director_name">{{ director_name }}</span></p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Environmental Health and Safety</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 5px;"><span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span></p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;"><span data-field="city_state_zip">{{ city_state_zip }}</span></p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Phone: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">E-mail: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Web: <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_2.jpg" alt="People walking image" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Tips for Pedestrians</h2>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>Walk on the sidewalk whenever possible. If there is no sidewalk and you have to walk in the road, always walk facing traffic so you are able to see oncoming vehicles.</li>
        <li>Wear brightly colored clothing that makes it easier for the driver to see you during the daytime. At night, wear special reflective clothing to reflect the headlights of oncoming vehicles.</li>
        <li>Cross only at corners or designated crosswalks.</li>
        <li>Try to establish eye contact with drivers before you enter the crosswalk. When you are uncertain if the driver sees you, let the driver pass.</li>
        <li>Do not engage in distracting behavior such as texting or wearing headphones to listen to music.</li>
        <li>For crosswalks controlled by a traffic signal, cross the street only when the "walk" signal is given. Additionally, be cautious of drivers when you are in the crosswalk.</li>
        <li>Never dart out into traffic. Look left, then right, then left again before crossing the street.</li>
        <li>Be mindful of a driver's blind spots.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Tips for Bus Transportation</h2>
      <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Getting on the Bus</h3>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>When waiting for the bus, line up on the curb.</li>
        <li>Wait until the bus has stopped and the door opens before stepping into the roadway.</li>
        <li>Use the hand rail when stepping into the bus.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Behavior on the Bus</h3>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>Promptly find a seat and sit down. If it is necessary to stand, hold onto the railing and do not cross the white line that is at the front of the bus.</li>
        <li>Never put your head, arms, or hands out of the window.</li>
        <li>Do not obstruct aisles with books, bags or other items.</li>
        <li>Wait for the bus to stop completely before getting up from your seat.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Getting off the Bus</h3>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>Use the hand rail when exiting the bus.</li>
        <li>Do not walk behind the bus or in between buses.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Tips for Drivers</h2>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>Wear a seatbelt at all times.</li>
        <li>Observe the speed limit.</li>
        <li>Drive defensively and yield to pedestrians.</li>
        <li>Do not drive aggressively and be respectful of other drivers and pedestrians.</li>
        <li>Yield to pedestrians already in the crosswalk.</li>
        <li>Do not tailgate.</li>
        <li>Do not drive when you are intoxicated, drowsy or impaired.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_3.jpg" alt="Cortland logo image" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>